The '''Senatorial Palace''',<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> also known as the '''Senatorial residence'''<ref name="Episode Guide">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/bombad-jedi-episode-guide|text="Bombad Jedi" Episode Guide &#124; The Clone Wars}}</ref> was located on the [[planet]] [[Rodia]]. It was the living quarters of [[Senator]] [[Onaconda Farr]], situated in an archipelago. The palace was situated behind the gates of the defensive dome that protected the residence. The palace itself had a [[hangar]] with a variety of equipment as well as a prison cell.<ref name="Bombad Jedi" />

